<section class="phero"><img class="phero-bg" src="/assets/img/photos/financial-calculator.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/financial-calculator-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/financial-calculator.webp 1200w" sizes="100vw" width="1200" height="749" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-zoom><div class="wrap"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><i aria-hidden="true">›</i><a href="/free-calculators/">Free calculators</a><i aria-hidden="true">›</i><span aria-current="page">ACV &amp; Holdback Worksheet</span></nav><p class="kicker">Free calculator</p><h1>RCV vs. ACV Calculator and Depreciation Holdback Worksheet</h1><p class="lede">Replacement cost policies usually pay in two installments. Itemize the loss to see how much arrives now, how much is held back and what you collect after repairs.</p></div></section>
<section class="sec tool-sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="rv">
<div class="tool tool-wide" data-tool="dep">
