<div class="wrap twocol"><article class="prose">
<h2>How the worksheet estimates depreciation</h2>
<p>It applies straight-line depreciation — age divided by expected life — up to the cap you choose. Carriers may adjust for condition or treat some items, like permits, as non-depreciable, so treat the result as a planning number.</p>
<h2>Life expectancies you’ll see in estimates</h2>
<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Common range</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Architectural asphalt shingles</th><td>25–30 years</td></tr><tr><th>Impact-resistant (Class 4) shingles</th><td>30+ years</td></tr><tr><th>Exposed-fastener metal roofing</th><td>30–40 years</td></tr><tr><th>Vinyl siding</th><td>25–40 years</td></tr><tr><th>Fiber-cement siding</th><td>40–50 years</td></tr><tr><th>Interior paint</th><td>8–12 years</td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>
<h2>Collecting the holdback</h2>
<p>Most replacement cost policies release recoverable depreciation after repairs are finished within a time limit. Send invoices and completion photos, and put the deadline on a calendar with the <a href="/free-calculators/claim-timeline-builder/">claim timeline builder</a>. Wyoming’s short building season can make a one-year window tight after a late-summer storm — ask for an extension in writing if you need one.</p>
<h2>Questions about this calculator</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>Is labor depreciated in Wyoming?</summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Practices vary by carrier and policy, and courts in different states have reached different answers. Ask the carrier to explain in writing whether and how labor was depreciated.</p></div></details><details><summary>What if I decide not to repair?</summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Under most replacement cost policies you keep the actual cash value payment but give up the held-back depreciation.</p></div></details></div><h2>More free calculators</h2><div class="rels"><a class="rel" href="/free-calculators/roof-area-pitch-waste/"><small>Calculator</small>Roof Area, Pitch &amp; Waste Calculator</a><a class="rel" href="/free-calculators/deductible-comparison/"><small>Calculator</small>Deductible Comparison Calculator</a><a class="rel" href="/free-calculators/claim-timeline-builder/"><small>Planner</small>Claim Timeline Builder</a></div></article><aside class="side"><div class="side-box side-call"><p class="side-t">Talk it through</p><p>The first conversation is free. We’ll tell you honestly whether appraisal fits your claim.</p><a class="side-tel" href="tel:+18445371427">+1 (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-block" href="/talk-to-us/">Send claim details</a></div><div class="side-box"><p class="side-t">All calculators</p><ul class="side-list"><li><a href="/free-calculators/award-net-gain-projector/">Award Net-Gain Projector</a></li><li><a href="/free-calculators/acv-holdback-worksheet/" aria-current="page">ACV &amp; Holdback Worksheet</a></li><li><a href="/free-calculators/roof-area-pitch-waste/">Roof Area, Pitch &amp; Waste Calculator</a></li><li><a href="/free-calculators/deductible-comparison/">Deductible Comparison Calculator</a></li><li><a href="/free-calculators/claim-timeline-builder/">Claim Timeline Builder</a></li><li><a href="/free-calculators/appraisal-ready-meter/">Appraisal Ready-Meter</a></li><li><a href="/free-calculators/